<title>EGYPT: Egypt's Misr H1 results.</title>
<headline>Egypt's Misr H1 results.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-08-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Misr International Bank/MIBANK results for the first half of the 1997 calendar year, the bank's financial year:</p>
<p>(All figures in Egyptian pounds)</p>
<p>				 30 June 97	30 June 96</p>
<p>Total customer deposits 6,322,145,096   6,394,056,090</p>
<p>Total assets	     9,369,746,503   9,033,641,595</p>
<p>Reserves			359,196,121     312,713,775</p>
<p>Provisions		    633,750,241     590,279,369</p>
<p>Shareholders funds	  549,708,530     454,644,850</p>
<p>Net period profits	   87,170,751	64,008,889</p>
<p>Full name is Misr International Bank/MIBANK.</p>
<p>$1 = 3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
